quest title=Almost Home
quest intro=The last high ground: the Frontier Corps' town, locked against the storms. The end of the voyage begins at the harbour.
# chapter 1: arrival (4)
step reach|harbour|1|Tie up at the Frontier's harbour
step read|Welcome board|1|Read the Corps' welcome board at the quay
step open|Harbour office locker|1|Take the town map from the harbour office
step reach|square|1|Walk to the town square at the terraces' foot
# chapter 2: the lower town (5)
step read|Smith's note|1|The smiths' quarter: read the smith's note in the forge
step kill|Hyena|3|Drive the dogs out of the forge yard
step read|Netmaker's note|1|The fishers' quarter: read the netmaker's note on the quay
step collect|story:wardenkey|1|Dive off the quay's end for the sunken net store and the smiths' key
step open|Forge chest|1|Open the forge's chest with the smiths' key
# chapter 3: the farms' water (6)
step reach|reservoir|1|Climb the terraces to the reservoir on the rim
step kill|Bear|1|Drive off the bear at the reservoir
step read|Reservoir keeper's note|1|Read the reservoir keeper's note
step collect|story:valvewheel|3|Find the sluice box's three valve wheels on the terraces
step collect|story:waterpass|1|Fit the wheels and open the sluice
step open|Farm store|1|Open the farm store with the water pass
# chapter 4: the upper town (8)
step read|Grower's note|1|The growers' quarter: read the grower's note
step catch|Goat|2|Catch two of the growers' goats
step open|Grower's chest|1|Open the grower's chest
step read|Builder's note|1|The builders' quarter: read the builder's board
step reach|buildertop|1|Climb the builders' tower to its top deck
step collect|story:sealtool|1|Take the archive's seal press from the top deck's crate
step reach|archive|1|Carry the seal press to the archive by the hall
step collect|story:seal|2|Press the archive's seal at its desk (the farm store's was the first)
# chapter 5: the hall (5)
step reach|hall|1|Go to the Corps' hall on the east rim
step read|Hall door plaque|1|Read the plaque by the hall's doors
step collect|story:seal|3|Fit the reed and sound the signal horn on its tower for the third seal
step reach|hallinside|1|Set the three seals in the hall's doors and go in
step read|Commander's last order|1|Read the commander's last order
# chapter 6: the end (4)
step reach|liftbottom|1|Ride the Corps' lift down to the cove
step reach|vault|1|Dive to the Corps' vault in the cove
step kill|Stingray|1|Face the giant stingray that has moved into the cove
step open|Corps' vault|1|Open the Corps' vault
quest done=The vault's logbook has a blank line at the bottom, waiting for your name. Up on the rim the hall's lamps are lit - and far out on the dark sea, one by one, the lights of the Corps' fleet turn towards them. You made it to the Frontier. You are home.
quest reward=TitaniumIngot*4;Battery_Advanced*2;Plank*20;Rope*10
# Buried treasure (one of the story line's last islands): titanium ore on top of Raft's own treasure loot - the metal detector finds it, the shovel digs it
call treasure x=0 z=0 r=55 n=1 seed=8803
prop treasure8803 treasure.loot=TitaniumOre*3

# --- Raft's vehicles (VI4, 2026-10-23): parked on open ground, clear of paths and quest objects ---
place VP_Forklift - at 45 89 ground sit yaw=90
# the generator's rocks that floated over the slope (VI4 ground check, 2026-10-24)
clear at 57.92 -27.76 r=1.5 only=SmallRock_03

save The Frontier
